sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Web User
    participant Browser as Web Browser (apps/web)
    participant Gateway as API Gateway / Rate Limiter
    participant AuthService as Identity & Auth Service
    participant PasswordEngine as Argon2id Engine
    participant Database as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Redis as Redis Session Cache

    User->>Browser: Enters email and password, clicks "Sign In"
    Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/auth/login { email, password }
    
    Gateway->>Redis: Check IP & email rate limit (Sliding window)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests (Retry-After)
        Browser-->>User: Display temporary cooldown message
    else Within Quota
        Gateway->>AuthService: Forward login request
        AuthService->>Database: SELECT id, password_hash, status FROM users WHERE email = :email
        alt User Not Found
            AuthService->>PasswordEngine: Execute dummy hash (Timing attack equalization)
            AuthService-->>Gateway: HTTP 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid email or password")
            Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
            Browser-->>User: Display generic error message
        else User Found
            AuthService->>PasswordEngine: Verify password (Argon2id)
            alt Password Mismatch
                AuthService->>Redis: Increment failed login attempts for IP/email
                AuthService-->>Gateway: HTTP 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid email or password")
                Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
                Browser-->>User: Display generic error message
            else Password Correct
                AuthService->>Redis: Reset failed login attempts
                AuthService->>AuthService: Generate fresh session token & CSRF secret
                AuthService->>Database: INSERT into sessions (user_id, token_hash, client_type='web')
                AuthService->>Redis: SET session:<token_hash> (user_id, csrf_secret, TTL=24h)
                
                AuthService-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 OK + Set-Cookie (sid) + X-CSRF-Token
                Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 OK (Set-Cookie: sid=...; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax)
                Browser->>Browser: Store CSRF token in memory; zero token in localStorage
                Browser-->>User: Redirect to Overview Dashboard
            end
        end
    end
